                    "NQWlj": {
                      "content": "Visibility"
                    },
                    "zMyh7": {
                      "content": "We create visibility for Black Canadians already doing the work — profiling engineers, scientists, and technologists at CSA, MDA, Telesat, CAE, L3Harris, DND, and beyond. The talent exists. We make sure it's seen."
